«НЕ NPC» — a trailer in the Firefly Pointillism style (Lemo-Opuscar library). An original story.

IMAGES, FOOTAGE, MODELS
- None. Every point of light (the city, the crowd, the boy, the door, the roof, the titles) is computed in code
  (film.py, engine.py). No photographs, no AI-generated images.

FONTS (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
- Cormorant Garamond — Christian Thalmann (Catharsis Fonts) — https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/cormorantgaramond
  (fonts/CormorantGaramond-OFL.txt); SemiBold and Medium instances made from the variable font with fontTools.

VOICE
- Russian narration: Gemini text-to-speech (model gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview, voice "Charon") through the Gemini API
  (Google AI Studio), tools/tts_gemini.py, with the film owner's API key. Synthetic voice. Check Google's Gemini API terms
  for how generated audio may be used.

MUSIC SAMPLES, through the library's core/audio/sampler.py (see core/audio/INSTRUMENTS.md for each library's licence)
- strings (violins, violas, cellos, spiccato, tremolo), horn, flute, timpani, harp, glockenspiel, gran cassa, suspended cymbal,
  crash, gong, hand chimes, tubular bells: VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition and Versilian Community Sample
  Library (Versilian Studios, CC0 1.0); glass harp, contrabass: FreePats or VSCO 2 CE (freepats.zenvoid.org, CC0 1.0).

SOUND EFFECTS
- Street murmur, footsteps, the glitch, hum, wind, deletion ticks, gusts and whooshes: synthesised in mix.py.

CODE
